msgstr "Importer un _dossier…"

#: crates/pigoune-app/ui/window.blp:196
msgid "Resources in the trash are deleted for good only when it is emptied."
msgstr ""
"Les ressources de la corbeille ne sont supprimées définitivement que "
"lorsqu’on la vide."

#: crates/pigoune-app/ui/window.blp:197 crates/pigoune-app/src/window.rs:685
msgid "_Empty Trash…"
msgstr "_Vider la corbeille…"

